  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif&quot;&gt;The proposed hip-to-gable roof extension would appear as a top-heavy addition to the modest dwelling that would unbalance the symmetry across the host terrace row and&amp;nbsp;be incongruous with the established character and appearance of the surrounding area which is characterised by semi-detached and terrace dwellings comprising hip pitched roofscapes. This is&amp;nbsp;especially notable&amp;nbsp;given the site&#x27;s location within the Becontree Estate non-designated heritage asset.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;As such, the proposed development is contrary to:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- National Planning Policy Framework&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;National Planning Policy Framework (NPPF) (December 2024);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- Policies D1, D4, D5 and D6 of the London Plan (March 2021);&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;- Policies SP2, DMD1 and DMD5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;of the London Borough of Barking and Dagenham&#x27;s Local Plan (September 2024);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span pt=&quot;&quot; sans&quot;,=&quot;&quot; sans-serif;&quot;=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;line-height: 14.98px;&quot;&gt;- The Residential Extensions and Alterations Supplementary Planning Document (February 2012)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
  ],
